          <msContents>
            <summary>
              <p>一張漢文患者求醫書札，附手繪人物與行線。館目著錄受信人 W. Cardwell；中文題名為整理者擬題。原件線條的顏色依館述，現用影像為灰階。</p>
              <ref target="https://wellcomecollection.org/works/ad3ygayb">館方書目</ref>
              <ref target="https://iiif.wellcomecollection.org/image/L0020813/info.json">館方影像清單</ref>
            </summary>
          </msContents>
          <history>
            <origin>
              <p>未署年，館目未著錄年代。</p>
            </origin>
          </history>
        </msDesc>
      </sourceDesc>
    </fileDesc>
